{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXdAkNXFBAlrD7cHU21KaAErVyIe5Zkx5x-oD0rCENEcuS_jCxY1XU-VNE6WU_zanIEEthBdzjjtXg0Tgssf_R52X_PC7SR-wqDc5uTTwORFL2e4RO5L1IfhHH4Ul3O983R9-RTl6g.jpg?t=1744298522\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stormbinders is a turn-based strategy game that immerses players in a world shattered by the breaking of the magical weave. Once a land of harmony, it now teeters on the brink of destruction where chaos has been unleashed, pitting powerful factions against one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who will bring balance back and forge a new destiny for the world?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/1.SeasonSwitch.gif?t=1744298522\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXf6TcG-f6Cz-4TemmlbG2u8GX07avEgwrOAondfcABYKjgWNlfcJW3C0x7S3pSfWMjH5Kad9exXrrgSK_aZDDIXuUrL2zgvRNPcNHCBArHxsyX1jS-QOPnz1Udb-hX_0WnH7dLn5Q.jpg?t=1744298522\" />During the epic single-player campaign, players can choose their hero and seal the fate of their kingdoms. The story progresses across unique scenarios, uncovering a tale of magic, heroism, unlikely alliances and betrayals.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/2.HerosJourney.gif?t=1744298522\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXfTnJuIVRW-cdfRtcsKBhXkpA3XWnrAlH1thMBmsiPGxzC2YHbE9fqn9d-zv6us3WN-4LwFKTnOP_O_NOoa6B9518nFpYweW5rSOXdLJS_Feg6RDM09_C3CHaDIzeO4O2Uc9tKPgg.jpg?t=1744298522\" />Stormbinders\u2019 unique and randomized storm system adds a new layer of strategy to every battle. Each time the game is launched, the weather patterns shift both in the global map and on the battlefield, putting the players in front of new challenges every time.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/3.DoubleThunder.gif?t=1744298522\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXf6t05NbsaC1W5amSvMpMNg-N-hC_1P1cz08f5s143AA2N4DD7UVTYy24FUrHmNBrXvA8AC00s_KSSRLlG5iFPwA1mgR9jLd6Kzk2z4qbF_rEd0NcH0dQ1egL-OBv2zGHqrFAeRfg.jpg?t=1744298522\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategy &amp; Conquest: the hero can ride through the global map to fight enemies and collect new resources.Castle management: the gathered resources can be used to upgrade the buildings in the players realm, recruit forces and expand their power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different factions: each faction has its own rules and distinct abilities that can consistently alter the gameplay.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXec6Zsu5zz1X4Y07rXmwA-75_7z4oh_zDmeSyn1vyVS9lR1X7yeJN0BUUMmrHiXgL-ZwJgNTZj5-9bGgvtxpgxgFdliIdHbu4whPMhWDkqrksSnfCgnLpejq9mf_3JF15JMW_cR2w.jpg?t=1744298522\" />Combats unfold on a classic hexagonal battlefield with an orthographic camera. Success depends on the composition of the armies, their positioning and the ability to cast strong spells against considering the enemy\u2019s strengths and weaknesses.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/4.Spells.gif?t=1744298522\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXd4Zagz03kwscSgLI2G-nN68T2m0u6KZjrs-UBHG5cD-lhgfcmqvLvWOzYqhRWxb0jmjBbZkClig3qipYCy8SD2j-DMK9wCmtoTLDp0A2Yvn7_4LyfaFrC3U2nPW4IbE9KHihU.jpg?t=1744298522\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each faction has more than 18 unique units, including legendary heroes, wise spellcasters and mystical creatures. Players can customize their armies, mixing different types of units to strategically create powerful synergies of abilities.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2134720?t=1744298522","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/913cdadccced63e8907c6412c202b10816cb1d85/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744298522","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/30257771ec16ab5740f7698dd9501bd6fbaf3fed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744298522","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/30257771ec16ab5740f7698dd9501bd6fbaf3fed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744298522","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXdAkNXFBAlrD7cHU21KaAErVyIe5Zkx5x-oD0rCENEcuS_jCxY1XU-VNE6WU_zanIEEthBdzjjtXg0Tgssf_R52X_PC7SR-wqDc5uTTwORFL2e4RO5L1IfhHH4Ul3O983R9-RTl6g.jpg?t=1744298522\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stormbinders is a turn-based strategy game that immerses players in a world shattered by the breaking of the magical weave. Once a land of harmony, it now teeters on the brink of destruction where chaos has been unleashed, pitting powerful factions against one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who will bring balance back and forge a new destiny for the world?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/1.SeasonSwitch.gif?t=1744298522\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXf6TcG-f6Cz-4TemmlbG2u8GX07avEgwrOAondfcABYKjgWNlfcJW3C0x7S3pSfWMjH5Kad9exXrrgSK_aZDDIXuUrL2zgvRNPcNHCBArHxsyX1jS-QOPnz1Udb-hX_0WnH7dLn5Q.jpg?t=1744298522\" />During the epic single-player campaign, players can choose their hero and seal the fate of their kingdoms. The story progresses across unique scenarios, uncovering a tale of magic, heroism, unlikely alliances and betrayals.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/2.HerosJourney.gif?t=1744298522\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXfTnJuIVRW-cdfRtcsKBhXkpA3XWnrAlH1thMBmsiPGxzC2YHbE9fqn9d-zv6us3WN-4LwFKTnOP_O_NOoa6B9518nFpYweW5rSOXdLJS_Feg6RDM09_C3CHaDIzeO4O2Uc9tKPgg.jpg?t=1744298522\" />Stormbinders\u2019 unique and randomized storm system adds a new layer of strategy to every battle. Each time the game is launched, the weather patterns shift both in the global map and on the battlefield, putting the players in front of new challenges every time.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/3.DoubleThunder.gif?t=1744298522\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXf6t05NbsaC1W5amSvMpMNg-N-hC_1P1cz08f5s143AA2N4DD7UVTYy24FUrHmNBrXvA8AC00s_KSSRLlG5iFPwA1mgR9jLd6Kzk2z4qbF_rEd0NcH0dQ1egL-OBv2zGHqrFAeRfg.jpg?t=1744298522\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategy &amp; Conquest: the hero can ride through the global map to fight enemies and collect new resources.Castle management: the gathered resources can be used to upgrade the buildings in the players realm, recruit forces and expand their power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different factions: each faction has its own rules and distinct abilities that can consistently alter the gameplay.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXec6Zsu5zz1X4Y07rXmwA-75_7z4oh_zDmeSyn1vyVS9lR1X7yeJN0BUUMmrHiXgL-ZwJgNTZj5-9bGgvtxpgxgFdliIdHbu4whPMhWDkqrksSnfCgnLpejq9mf_3JF15JMW_cR2w.jpg?t=1744298522\" />Combats unfold on a classic hexagonal battlefield with an orthographic camera. Success depends on the composition of the armies, their positioning and the ability to cast strong spells against considering the enemy\u2019s strengths and weaknesses.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/4.Spells.gif?t=1744298522\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXd4Zagz03kwscSgLI2G-nN68T2m0u6KZjrs-UBHG5cD-lhgfcmqvLvWOzYqhRWxb0jmjBbZkClig3qipYCy8SD2j-DMK9wCmtoTLDp0A2Yvn7_4LyfaFrC3U2nPW4IbE9KHihU.jpg?t=1744298522\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each faction has more than 18 unique units, including legendary heroes, wise spellcasters and mystical creatures. Players can customize their armies, mixing different types of units to strategically create powerful synergies of abilities.</p>","developers":["Destructive Creations","Innominate Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/9847ab379dc5aaacc3d1dd6ee3c4d2fe6b7e95a3/header.jpg?t=1744298522","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Slitherine Software UK Ltd. All Rights Reserved. Stormbinders, Slitherine Software UK Ltd. and their Logos are all trademarks of Slitherine Software UK Ltd. All other marks and trademarks are the property of their respective owners. Developed by Destructive Creations and Innominate Games.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124507,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124507/movie480.mp4?t=1